From 1a486577597d4ec15b530c530f9b01eeef65c6a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexandru Chimac <alex@chimac.ro>
Date: Sun, 14 Sep 2025 20:44:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] arm64: dts: exynos: Add initial support for the
 Exynos9610 SoC

The Exynos9610 SoC is found in 2020-2021 Samsung Galaxy A/M-series devices.
Add basic support for this SoC, including:

- All 8 cores
- ChipID
- Generic timer
- pinctrl
- clocks

Signed-off-by: Alexandru Chimac <alex@chimac.ro>
---
